Package: com.heavenzy.tweak
Name: Heavenzy
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Per-app device identity reset (Blaze-style): keeps your real iPhone model but resets serial, UDID, IDFV, IDFA, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth MAC and IMEI, plus a wipe + re-spoof that clears saved accounts and blocks iCloud restore, so an app sees a brand-new phone with a first-time install. Configure apps in the Heavenzy app, or use the in-app panel via a two-finger long-press.
Maintainer: Heavenzy
Author: Heavenzy
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
